      "tpd_reading": "<div>\n<table align=\"left\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"vertical-align:top\"><strong>單元二：人生不只一條路</strong><br />\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong>《左傳》公子重耳之亡</strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
